<div id="urduTextPath">عون و محمد (ع)/یہ ذکر ابھی تھا کہ صدا رونے کی آئی</div>
<p>dozaq se jab aazad kiya hurr ko quda ne<br />
khul-wa diye firdous ke dar uqda kusha ne<br />
zaanu pa rakha sar ko imam-e- dosara ne<br />
aala kiya adna ko buzurgou ki duaa ne</p>

<p>sab jiske talabgaar the jannat me wo dar tha<br />
hooran-e- jinaa'n gird thi aur beech me hurr tha<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>jab de chuke sab ghair azeezo ki tarha sar<br />
bejaa huwe do el-chi shaah ke dilbar<br />
marne pe kamar baandh-te the qasim-e be par<br />
kehti thi jhukaaye huwe sar shah ki qaahar</p>

<p>hai saqt ajab dono ki daanayi se mujh ko<br />
in beto'n ne mehboob kiya bhai se mujh ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye zikr abhi tha ke sada rone ki aayi<br />
darwaze se akbar ne ye awaaz sunaayi<br />
looti gayi hai hai phupi amma ki kamaayi<br />
maare gaye do saath ke khele huwe bhaayi</p>

<p>rote huwe abbas bhi hamraah gaye hai<br />
qud laashe uthane ke liye shaah gaye hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>fizza ki sada aayi ke aye peetne walo<br />
sab milke are meri quzaadi ko sambhalo<br />
roti hai kidhar bano-e- aalam ko bulalao<br />
loota gaya ghar qaak-e- azaa balo'n pa daalo</p>

<p>maqtal se hussain ibn-e-ali laate hai laashe<br />
saidaaniyo dyodhi pa chalo aate hai laashe<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>lasho'n ko shahedee'n saf-e-matam pa jo laaye<br />
sab ahl-e- haram peet-te rote huwe aaye<br />
zainab ne na faryaad ki ne ashk bahaaye<br />
baithi rahi sar zaanu-e- aqdas pa jhukaaye</p>

<p>lab qushk the mu faq tha, miza ashko'n se tar thi<br />
ne apne na bhai ki na lasho'n ki qabar thi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>bano ne rakhe zaano-e- zainab pa sar unke<br />
jo bibiyaa'n thi aagaye mu ko jigar unke<br />
zainab ne jo ki jhuk ke ruqo'n pe nazar unke<br />
dikhlaayi diye chand se mu qoo'n me tar unke</p>

<p>ruqsaar bhi majrooh the, abru bhi kate the<br />
shane bhi juda chand se baazu bhi kate the<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>mu chaatiyo'n pe rakh ke wo nashaad pukari<br />
aaram me ho ya hai ghashi pyas se taari<br />
hota hai bayaa'n shoukato himmat ka tumhari<br />
tasleem karo qibla-e-kounain ko wari</p>

<p>samjhi mai ke ba'as hai ye bedariye shab ka<br />
pyaro ye tareeqa nahi arbabe adab ka<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>tareef imama-e- dosara karte hai uttho<br />
abbas-e- alamdar sana karte hai uttho<br />
hamshakle nabi mad'he vegha karte hai uttho<br />
sab log na uthne ka gila karte hai uttho</p>

<p>aaqa se musibat me juda ho nahi jaate<br />
sadqe gayi yu jung ke din so nahi jaate<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>pyaro tum akele kabhi nikle nahi ghar se<br />
raste se na waqif na sobat-e- safar se<br />
raahe'n wo ke qaali nahi jo qouf-o-qatar se<br />
jo qaasa-e- baari hai wo tharrate hain dar se</p>

<p>is qouf se rato'n ko na sote the mohammed<br />
jab mout ka zikr aata tha rote the mohammed<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>hai hai wahi rasta tumhe darpesh hai pyaro<br />
tum mard ho jarrar ho himmat ko na haaro<br />
ab aankhou se chhup jaaoge aye arsh ke taaro<br />
baccho mujhe manzil ka pata deke sidharo</p>

<p>virane me ya gulshane hasti me rahoge<br />
tum aajki shab kounsi basti me rahoge<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>taariki me vaari tumhe neend aayegi kyu'n kar<br />
shab hogi to bachou ko ye maa paayegi kyu'n kar<br />
maadar dil-e- betaab ko samjhayegi kyu'n kar<br />
waa'n tak mere rone ki sada jaayegi kyu'n kar</p>

<p>nikloo'n jo tajassus me to bejaa nahi waari<br />
maa hoo'n mera pathar ka kaleja nahi waari<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>maqtal me qiyaam aaj kaha'n hoga batado<br />
maa sadqe muqaam aaj kaha'n hoga batado<br />
din tumko tamaam aaj kaha'n hoga batado<br />
bistar sar-e- sham aaj kaha'n hoga batado</p>

<p>hamwaar zamee'n shab ke bichone ko milegi<br />
kaisi hai jagah jo tumhe sone ko milegi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>hamraah na takiya hai na raahat ka bichona<br />
do bhai ho tum ek jagah raat ko sona<br />
maloom hai chote ka tumhe chounk ke rona<br />
sadqe gayi ghaafil mere bachhe se na hona</p>

<p>be maa ke sehar rone me hojati thi usko<br />
pehlu mera milta tha to neend aati thi usko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>tukde tha kaleja ye bayaa'n dard ke sun kar<br />
ek hashr tha saidaniyaa'n jab peet-ti thi sar<br />
bano ne kaha qibla-e- kounain se uth kar<br />
marjaayegi maa lashou'n ko le jaiye bahar</p>

<p>farzandou'n ka gham qaaleqe aalam na dikhaye'n<br />
allah kisi maa ko ye maatam na dikhaye'n<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>